WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.619 --> 00:00:17.501
Zann thought as he landed in front of Vilkor's farmhouse.

2
00:00:18.262 --> 00:00:21.484
It had taken him and Perda two days to get there from the mines.

3
00:00:22.404 --> 00:00:27.527
The first zap had drained most of his energy, and both of them had needed to rest before

4
00:00:27.587 --> 00:00:33.179
continuing. Perda had speculated that the magic energy from the well was still making its way to the

5
00:00:33.299 --> 00:00:36.261
farthest reaches of Terrica, including the mines.

6
00:00:36.942 --> 00:00:39.023
That meant energy was weaker out there.

7
00:00:39.043 --> 00:00:44.707
"She really is the smartest person I know," Zann thought, glancing over at her.

8
00:00:45.328 --> 00:00:46.849
He was happy they were back together.

9
00:00:47.529 --> 00:00:52.192
He was sure the two of them could figure out a plan to rescue Mellis and Zing and

10
00:00:52.232 --> 00:00:53.713
escape back to Magica.

11
00:00:54.594 --> 00:00:57.356
Because of her Shackles, Perda stumbled when they landed.

12
00:00:58.024 --> 00:00:59.906
Zann grabbed her arm to steady her.

13
00:00:59.926 --> 00:01:02.208
"Thanks," she said.

14
00:01:02.228 --> 00:01:04.830
"I wish I could get these Shackles off!"

15
00:01:05.690 --> 00:01:09.273
"We'll convince Zira to remove them," Zann said confidently.

16
00:01:09.293 --> 00:01:11.555
"Do you have enough energy for another zap?"

17
00:01:11.575 --> 00:01:13.997
"Yes," Perda said.

18
00:01:14.017 --> 00:01:16.859
"But I'm not sure where Mellis and Zing are now.

19
00:01:17.620 --> 00:01:21.483
Should we go to Zira's house to look for them or to Vilkor's new mansion?"

20
00:01:22.304 --> 00:01:24.385
A man who was hurrying by stopped.

21
00:01:24.405 --> 00:01:27.248
"Are you looking for Sir Vilkor and Zira?"

22
00:01:27.660 --> 00:01:28.861
he asked excitedly.

23
00:01:28.881 --> 00:01:33.002
"I just heard Vilkor is offering more magical gifts out by the well!

24
00:01:33.483 --> 00:01:34.463
I'm going there now."

25
00:01:35.243 --> 00:01:36.364
The man hurried away.

26
00:01:36.384 --> 00:01:39.685
"Let's go see what's going on," Zann said.

27
00:01:40.185 --> 00:01:41.806
He and Perda zapped to the well.

28
00:01:42.586 --> 00:01:44.307
Dozens of people were gathered there.

29
00:01:45.027 --> 00:01:49.189
Zann noticed that the tree had grown even more since the last time he'd seen it.

30
00:01:49.689 --> 00:01:52.270
It was nearly bursting out of the wall around the well.

31
00:01:53.251 --> 00:01:54.691
"Stay back, everyone!"

32
00:01:55.172 --> 00:01:55.912
Vilkor shouted.

33
00:01:56.652 --> 00:01:58.954
He was standing near the wall facing the crowd.

34
00:01:59.814 --> 00:02:02.436
"What in the worlds is he wearing?"

35
00:02:02.936 --> 00:02:03.557
Perda asked.

36
00:02:03.577 --> 00:02:07.520
"It looks like he created another fancy outfit for himself."

37
00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:15.745
Zann stared at Vilkor's clothing, which consisted of an elaborate robe, fancy boots with pointy toes, and a

38
00:02:15.865 --> 00:02:16.786
golden crown.

39
00:02:17.486 --> 00:02:20.889
He noticed a necklace decorated with several shiny red scales.

40
00:02:20.909 --> 00:02:23.050
"Hey!" he exclaimed.

41
00:02:23.070 --> 00:02:25.112
"Those look like dragon scales!"

42
00:02:25.900 --> 00:02:26.761
He rushed forward.

43
00:02:27.461 --> 00:02:32.345
Vilkor was rubbing one hand on his side while waving his other hand around dramatically.

44
00:02:32.365 --> 00:02:37.469
"A new basin in which to bathe your baby," he said.

45
00:02:37.489 --> 00:02:39.031
"Here it is!"

46
00:02:40.312 --> 00:02:41.873
A small metal tub appeared.

47
00:02:42.754 --> 00:02:46.376
The crowd gasped as a young woman repeatedly thanked Vilkor.

48
00:02:46.396 --> 00:02:50.960
"You are truly wise and generous, Sir Vilkor!"

49
00:02:51.661 --> 00:02:53.462
She grabbed the tub and ran off.

50
00:02:54.163 --> 00:02:57.425
Zann marched up to Vilkor, with Perda hopping behind him.

51
00:02:57.445 --> 00:02:59.806
"Where did you get those dragon scales?"

52
00:03:00.126 --> 00:03:00.606
he asked.

53
00:03:00.626 --> 00:03:01.927
"Where's Zing?"

54
00:03:01.947 --> 00:03:04.068
"Hey, wait your turn!"

55
00:03:04.608 --> 00:03:05.428
a man complained.

56
00:03:05.448 --> 00:03:07.709
"We all came to ask favors."

57
00:03:08.770 --> 00:03:09.850
Perda rolled her eyes.

58
00:03:09.870 --> 00:03:11.991
"That's not why we're here.

59
00:03:12.692 --> 00:03:16.413
We need a moment with Sir Vilkor, so stay back!"

60
00:03:17.534 --> 00:03:21.496
She snapped her fingers and created a Shield between herself and the crowd.

61
00:03:22.236 --> 00:03:25.819
Zann barely noticed the villagers' cries of surprise and annoyance.

62
00:03:26.519 --> 00:03:28.540
He was still focused on those red scales.

63
00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:32.803
"Oh! You two are alive!"

64
00:03:33.484 --> 00:03:36.706
Vilkor actually sounded pleased to see Zann and Perda.

65
00:03:37.366 --> 00:03:38.847
"Glad to see it.

66
00:03:39.608 --> 00:03:41.849
Zira wouldn't tell me where she'd sent you."

67
00:03:42.490 --> 00:03:43.110
He frowned.

68
00:03:43.130 --> 00:03:47.553
"It's almost as if she thinks she's in charge of this whole operation."

69
00:03:48.514 --> 00:03:50.215
"Okay, but where's my dragon?"

70
00:03:50.675 --> 00:03:51.196
Zann said.

71
00:03:51.728 --> 00:03:55.770
"If you hurt him "Don't worry," Vilkor said.

72
00:03:55.790 --> 00:03:58.431
"The fiery little creature is fine.

73
00:03:59.251 --> 00:04:04.193
These scales came off when he was fighting to get out of that cage the plonk farmer put

74
00:04:04.233 --> 00:04:04.533
him in."

75
00:04:05.374 --> 00:04:05.934
He chuckled.

76
00:04:05.954 --> 00:04:09.575
"He almost succeeded, actually.

77
00:04:10.036 --> 00:04:15.258
He'd burned halfway through the side before Zira created a metal cage to replace the old one."

78
00:04:15.998 --> 00:04:17.419
"But where is he now?"

79
00:04:17.879 --> 00:04:18.459
Perda asked.

80
00:04:19.259 --> 00:04:21.544
"At Zira's mansion," Vilkor replied.

81
00:04:22.204 --> 00:04:25.005
"Nobody in Terrica has seen anything like him.

82
00:04:26.005 --> 00:04:29.766
It really impresses the villagers when he breathes fire!"

83
00:04:31.427 --> 00:04:33.848
Zann was relieved to hear that Zing was safe.

84
00:04:34.528 --> 00:04:37.629
But he was dismayed that the little dragon was Zira's prisoner.

85
00:04:37.649 --> 00:04:39.729
"Vilkor," Perda said.

86
00:04:40.349 --> 00:04:41.390
"Where's Mellis?"

87
00:04:42.490 --> 00:04:43.650
Vilkor looked troubled.

88
00:04:43.670 --> 00:04:45.911
"She's with Zira too.

89
00:04:46.651 --> 00:04:50.092
Zira claims that the girl has especially strong magic powers."

90
00:04:50.892 --> 00:04:51.752
He rolled his eyes.

91
00:04:51.772 --> 00:04:54.073
"Which I doubt is true.

92
00:04:54.993 --> 00:04:58.774
Mellis has always been a perfectly ordinary girl in every way.

93
00:04:59.334 --> 00:05:02.235
But Zira wants her close so she can train her.

94
00:05:02.875 --> 00:05:07.197
She also wanted to punish her for injuring one of her men with that rock she conjured a

95
00:05:07.237 --> 00:05:07.917
few days ago."

96
00:05:07.937 --> 00:05:10.638
"What?" Perda cried.

97
00:05:10.658 --> 00:05:14.079
"But she was only protecting herself—and me!

98
00:05:15.059 --> 00:05:16.619
Those goons attacked us!"

99
00:05:17.620 --> 00:05:18.440
Vilkor shrugged.

100
00:05:19.116 --> 00:05:21.217
"The man ended up with a nasty bruise."

101
00:05:21.857 --> 00:05:24.758
He seemed to be already losing interest in the conversation.

102
00:05:25.419 --> 00:05:28.520
His gaze wandered toward the crowd behind Perda's Shield.

103
00:05:28.540 --> 00:05:32.181
"Now if you'll excuse me, my fans are waiting."

104
00:05:33.182 --> 00:05:34.962
"No, we won't excuse you!"

105
00:05:35.603 --> 00:05:36.663
Perda glared at him.

106
00:05:36.683 --> 00:05:39.164
"Mellis is your only relative!

107
00:05:39.744 --> 00:05:42.125
How can you allow Zira to mistreat her?"

108
00:05:43.066 --> 00:05:45.727
Zann could see that Vilkor wasn't really listening.

109
00:05:46.387 --> 00:05:50.613
The crowd was chanting his name, and he was watching the group with a smile.

110
00:05:51.453 --> 00:05:54.915
Zann tried to think of a way to get through to him so he might help them.

111
00:05:54.935 --> 00:05:58.736
"Vilkor only really cares about himself," Zann thought.

112
00:05:59.357 --> 00:06:00.617
That gave him an idea.

113
00:06:00.637 --> 00:06:04.819
"It's not right that Zira is making all the decisions," Zann blurted out.

114
00:06:04.839 --> 00:06:07.040
"The well is on your property.

115
00:06:07.640 --> 00:06:09.761
That means you should be in charge, right?"

116
00:06:11.062 --> 00:06:13.643
Vilkor frowned, suddenly looking annoyed.

117
00:06:13.663 --> 00:06:15.924
"That's true, boy.

118
00:06:17.492 --> 00:06:21.713
What right does she have to order me around and try to run things?

119
00:06:22.334 --> 00:06:25.415
Perhaps I'd better speak to her about it immediately.

120
00:06:26.555 --> 00:06:31.176
Zap!" He disappeared, prompting a disappointed sigh from the crowd.

121
00:06:31.917 --> 00:06:33.277
Zann glanced at Perda.

122
00:06:33.877 --> 00:06:35.798
"I'm sure he just zapped to Zira's place.

123
00:06:36.238 --> 00:06:36.878
Let's follow him."

124
00:06:37.798 --> 00:06:41.880
She nodded, waited for Zann to grab her arm, and then snapped her fingers.

125
00:06:41.900 --> 00:06:42.940
"Zap!"
